      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi AOSP Team, During recent testing we discovered this issue. AudioOutputDescriptor::setVolume will determine whether the volume has been modified. If the volume has not been modified, there will be no way to reach the logic related to hasStream(streams, AUDIO_STREAM_BLUETOOTH_SCO). But if there is setVolume source voice after setVolume source bluetoothsco, the volume of voice will be inconsistent with bluetoothsco.\nPlease help with review, thanks.",
      "revId": "41d0b54b63b4059010633b9d715a35d8648fa473",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
